!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/vocabulary/invalid/ipv4-short-form-rejected.tson"
{
  spec: "§5.5"
  description: "RFC 3986's IPv4address production requires exactly four dotted dec-octets; the legacy BSD-style class-based short form (three octets) is not that shape, even though some IP parsers accept it leniently"
  outcome: error
  category: resolver
  type-ref: "ipv4"
}
